When a client calls and says, “I need pictures of my people in action,” you call the photog you know who was embedded at one point with @101stabndivaa and spent time on tour with @officialcsny to get the best shots of people you can get. @jparti has been lucky enough to photograph a wide variety of folks including @lyle_lovett @lorettalynnofficial @john_prine and even a few past presidents – just to name a few. 

But John’s real talent is capturing the emotion of everyday people in the course of their lives. He captures their joy, their anger, their surprise and their despair without a need for words. 

