January 2nd 2023 Day 2 and we're sidelit

@markzulkoskey and I chase up to the Bulyea Sub and begin our day with #CPE07-31 as it works the Richardson Pioneer Terminal west of Southey, maintaining #CP9023 (#SD40_2F ) as yesterday's leader as it spots grain cars. #CP9022 (#SD40-2F) would take over the lead once they finish work and return light power back towards Moose Jaw for the night with #CP9021 (SD40-2F) continuing to thirdwheel the lash up.

